== 19. 开关
  RSH_NO_AGENT_FIX=1 → unit=failed ssh-add -l rc=2
  RSH_AGENT=off      → unit=failed ssh-add -l rc=2
  RSH_AGENT=always   → unit=active ssh-add -l rc=0，242 ms
